            "rationale": "The block rule is enforced in Tier 2: ensureNotBlocked is called from Loans.borrow, Loans.renew and Holds.place. The change also deletes the CLI's own copy of the rule, which summed fines and payments and compared with 5.00m. The CLI now only calls use cases. The Tier 3 views (members, standing) ask Accounts.isBlocked and Accounts.owed instead of deciding. Tier 3 still holds the error wording, which is presentation.",
