              }
            ],
            "rationale": "The 5.00 threshold and the owed computation each have one definition, Policy.blockingBalance and Accounts.owed. The message and the views reference them. The CLI's duplicate fines-minus-payments calculation and its 5.00m literal are removed. The only 5.00 left is in test expectations.",
